# Keep the working tree identical across platforms: the repository stores LF and
# gofmt (and diff review) expects LF. Without this, a Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true reports every file as unformatted.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.go text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
